+## Sales and variance
+
+- `POST /import/sales` takes `{ "csv": "..." }` with the columns
+  `ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty` and answers `{ "tickets": n, "dishes": n }`
+  (`dishes` is the total `qty` imported). Tickets already imported are
+  skipped. One bad row or an item running out imports nothing; the
+  `bad_request` message names the row (`row 2` is the first data row).
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` lists per item
+  `theoretical` (from sales sold in those days), `actual` (every `consume`
+  movement in those days) and `difference` (actual - theoretical).
